{"id":"n61518-1-12","stage":1,"title":"미래 · 未来","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61518-1-12-1","ko":"지금으로부터 십 년 뒤에는 우리가 어떻게 변해 있을까?","zh":"从现在开始十年后，我们会变成什么样呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금으로부터","meaning":"现在，这会儿","explanation":"지금：现在，这会儿；으로부터：表示时间、地点、对象等的起点：“从……”。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62523","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금으로부터","audio":"/audio/f272d40d1badab59464d.mp3"}},{"text":"십","meaning":"十","explanation":"십：十。","readings":[{"term":"십","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28847","senseId":"1","lemma":"십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"십","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3"}},{"text":"년","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年。","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseId":"1","lemma":"년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤에는","meaning":"之后，下一个，接下来","explanation":"뒤：之后，下一个，接下来；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"뒤","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67477","senseId":"5","lemma":"뒤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤에는","audio":"/audio/8ec318eeb31b95855f70.mp3"}},{"text":"우리가","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리가","audio":"/audio/49bdae052f6acaf1e2d7.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"변해","meaning":"变，改变，变成","explanation":"변하다：变，改变，变成；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"변하다","audio":"/audio/35e71a5db7e3493cf6ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58881","senseId":"1","lemma":"변하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"변해","audio":"/audio/2dcd98e1a76e6345b1f0.mp3"}},{"text":"있을까?","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있을까","audio":"/audio/263e0eb545ea59d74b53.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在，这会儿","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62523","definition":"在说话的当时；或此时此刻。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"c7470d030eddae16","term":"십","zh":"十","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3","entryId":"28847","definition":"九加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["십"]},{"id":"e23df8834a583975","term":"년","zh":"年","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3","entryId":"26823","definition":"计算年度的数量单位。","pronunciation":["년"]},{"id":"c65326b2de936236","term":"뒤","zh":"之后，下一个，接下来","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3","entryId":"67477","definition":"接着前一个。","pronunciation":["뒤ː"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"35e71a5db7e3493c","term":"변하다","zh":"变，改变，变成","audio":"/audio/35e71a5db7e3493cf6ff.mp3","entryId":"58881","definition":"成为其他东西或性质发生变动。","pronunciation":["변ː하다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7fd772111c9f444f71f4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61518-1-12-2","ko":"글쎄. 미래는 알 수 없는 거니까.","zh":"谁知道呢。毕竟未来是无法预知的啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"글쎄.","meaning":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","explanation":"글쎄：也许吧，或许吧，难说。","readings":[{"term":"글쎄","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29723","senseId":"1","lemma":"글쎄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글쎄","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3"}},{"text":"미래는","meaning":"未来，将来","explanation":"미래：未来，将来；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"미래","audio":"/audio/44779ffe007a1d51faa7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61518","senseId":"1","lemma":"미래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미래는","audio":"/audio/4fac6132f4173f4d839c.mp3"}},{"text":"알","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알","audio":"/audio/63251c05b0dbf37fa9f0.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"없는","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없는","audio":"/audio/9064a5c0bfdea4101ee3.mp3"}},{"text":"거니까.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니까：在句末解释原因或依据：“因为、毕竟”。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거니까","audio":"/audio/1f361968583a107906f4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7ca52d3e5ceed208","term":"글쎄","zh":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3","entryId":"29723","definition":"对于对方所提出的问题或要求，表现出不确定的态度。","pronunciation":["글쎄"]},{"id":"44779ffe007a1d51","term":"미래","zh":"未来，将来","audio":"/audio/44779ffe007a1d51faa7.mp3","entryId":"61518","definition":"即将到来的时候。","pronunciation":["미ː래"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/b536a64ff0d51069d1c5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.68,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61518","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":54,"sequenceScore":2.4053,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["谁知道呢。毕竟未来是无法预知的啊。","从现在开始十年后，我们会变成什么样呢？","那位僧人为什么一直独自自言自语呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["从现在开始十年后，我们会变成什么样呢？","那位僧人为什么一直独自自言自语呢？","谁知道呢。毕竟未来是无法预知的啊。"],"answer":2}]}
